      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Slider 1.5 RC1 (4)</h3><ul>
<li>Slider now updates itself automatically — new builds arrive in the background.</li>
<li>Safari and Chrome are combined into one Browsers view; PowerPoint is the default view.</li>
<li>Settings is now a standard macOS window with a Diagnostics tab.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
